1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,191
Part four. Your team and what each person can do.

2
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:08,312
Go to Settings, then Users and access.

3
00:00:08,312 --> 00:00:12,432
Everyone who uses SuryaSetu has their own login.

4
00:00:12,432 --> 00:00:13,548
Tap Add user.

5
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:20,769
Fill in the name, email and mobile, and choose a role: Sales for the sales team,

6
00:00:20,769 --> 00:00:26,534
Technician for site staff, Accounts for billing, Manager for supervisors.

7
00:00:26,534 --> 00:00:28,904
Set a first password and save.

8
00:00:29,810 --> 00:00:32,934
Each role comes with sensible access.

9
00:00:32,934 --> 00:00:35,719
To fine-tune it, edit the person.

10
00:00:35,719 --> 00:00:41,713
For each app choose none, read only, own records only, all, or manager.

11
00:00:41,713 --> 00:00:47,116
Own records only means a sales person sees just their own leads.

12
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:51,620
When someone leaves, edit them and untick Active.

13
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:56,998
They can no longer sign in, but everything they did stays in the records.

14
00:00:57,890 --> 00:01:02,807
Under My account, anyone can change their own password and mobile number,

15
00:01:02,807 --> 00:01:06,309
and choose light or dark mode and the screen layout.

16
00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:11,511
Next video: Leads: capture enquiries and follow up.

